title: TEST_Start
---
// Test sheet for every Yarn command and function in the project.
// Run: in DaySchedule_Demo.asset set Day 1's Start Node to TEST_Start, then Play. Set it back afterwards.
// Docs per command: Docs/YarnCommands/
// The flow starts in BeforeOpen › StoryBeforeOpen (this node is the "story before opening").
Player: (TEST) Start. flow_phase = {flow_phase()}, flow_step = {flow_step()} #line:0330684 
Player: (TEST) Expect BeforeOpen / StoryBeforeOpen. #line:0a7a233 
Player: (TEST) Day {$day}. Day-1 kit: Gin = {ingredient_unlocked("Gin")} (expect True), Whiskey = {ingredient_unlocked("Whiskey")} (expect False on day 1) #line:0def93c 

// flow_check_events: Story -> Event -> back to Story, then the next line plays.
<<flow_check_events>>
Player: (TEST) After flow_check_events. flow_step = {flow_step()} (expect StoryBeforeOpen). Day 1: no unlock popup. #line:09f270f 

-> Test the BeforeOpen-only commands, then open the bar #line:06662f5 
    <<jump TEST_BeforeOpen>>
-> Test the ingredient unlock popup (BeforeOpen), then open the bar #line:088731a 
    <<jump TEST_UnlockPopup>>
-> Open the bar now #line:05fc441 
    <<jump TEST_OpenBar>>
===

